{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】日本首相高市早苗由馬尼拉轉抵深圳。</p>\n<p>高市早苗在菲律賓出席完東盟系列會議後，乘坐飛機轉抵深圳，準備出席APEC領導人非正式會議，是高市就任日本首相後首次到訪中國。</p>\n<p>國家主席習近平今晚設宴歡迎出席峰會的領袖，日本傳媒關注高市與中方領導人的互動。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T10:04:00.026245+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"Now 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T09:37:26+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:25.699135+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T09:57:25.699135+00:00","content_hash":"226a0ff79f5a93fb07bd3deb328c9631ada030616ad02db075ba90296287c154","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}